OL,3,ACopper wire upgrade behind US flight
OL,4,Asuspension, transport secretary says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nationwide US ground stop that caused
OL,7,Fthousands of flight cancellations and
OL,8,Fprompted travel chaos was caused by a
OL,9,Ftechnical issue following a copper wire
OL,10,Fupgrade, the transport secretary has
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FSean Duffy told a news conference that
OL,14,Fthe government was trying to find out
OL,15,Fwhether the problem that led to air
OL,16,Ftraffic controllers suspending
OL,17,Ftake-offs for four hours on Friday had
OL,18,Fbeen caused by "incompetence" on the
OL,19,Fpart of the company doing the upgrades
OL,20,For faulty equipment.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
